; Export surface of the PE shim. The eight flat entry points are exactly those
; of vkd3d-proton's own libs/d3d12/d3d12.def; everything else in D3D12 is
; reached through COM vtables and needs no export.
;
; The build uses __declspec(dllexport) rather than this file, so this is
; documentation plus the input for llvm-dlltool when something wants an import
; library to link against d3d12.dll.
;
; D3D12SDKVersion / D3D12SDKPath are DATA: the AgilitySDK contract reads them
; as variables, not as calls. vkd3d-proton exports D3D12SDKVersion from
; d3d12core.dll (libs/d3d12core/d3d12core.def, "DATA PRIVATE"); this shim
; carries both because docs/d3d12-boundary-analysis.md §1 lists them as part of
; what d3d12.dll presents.
;
; NOT exported, deliberately: D3D12CoreCreateLayeredDevice,
; D3D12CoreGetLayeredDeviceSize, D3D12CoreRegisterLayers. vkd3d-proton exports
; none of them and no game imports them; see the note at the end of the export
; block in pe/d3d12_shim.c.
LIBRARY d3d12.dll
EXPORTS
    D3D12CreateDevice
    D3D12GetDebugInterface
    D3D12GetInterface
    D3D12CreateRootSignatureDeserializer
    D3D12CreateVersionedRootSignatureDeserializer
    D3D12SerializeRootSignature
    D3D12SerializeVersionedRootSignature
    D3D12EnableExperimentalFeatures
    D3D12SDKVersion DATA
    D3D12SDKPath DATA
